      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "The wallet merges preset (`MANUAL`) inputs with the automatic coin selection result in `spend.cpp`. With the mutant applied, the merged result is incorrectly reported as `MANUAL` instead of the algorithm that actually selected the coins.\n\nThe test checks both cases:\n- Preset inputs merged into an automatic result should keep the automatic algorithm.\n- A `MANUAL` result merged with another result should take the algorithm of the other result.\n\nWith the mutant applied, both checks fail with `manual != bnb`.",
